3
00:00:13,994 --> 00:00:17,319
to run, and a registry is the
server that stores images.

4
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:22,433
That tag was pushed four times this week.
It names whatever was pushed last, not

5
00:00:22,473 --> 00:00:27,246
what is running. To answer the question,
