7
00:00:32,399 --> 00:00:36,877
The team could have answered in one command
if the image had been identified by

8
00:00:36,917 --> 00:00:41,510
something that can't move, and if that
identifier had been recorded together with

9
00:00:41,550 --> 00:00:46,314
the commit, the saved snapshot of the source.
This video is about making an artifact

10
00:00:46,354 --> 00:00:50,775
carry its own answer. Keep that question.
By the end it has a one-line answer.

11
00:00:52,615 --> 00:00:56,288
